===== .claude/rules/forge-alembic.md
Alembic with an async engine: `alembic/env.py` runs migrations through `run_async_migrations()` and `connection.run_sync()`. New revisions: `alembic revision --autogenerate -m "<change>"`. Committed revisions are never edited.

===== .claude/rules/forge-fastapi.md
FastAPI. Dependencies use `Annotated[T, Depends(...)]`. Startup and shutdown use `lifespan`. Request and response bodies are Pydantic v2 models.

===== .claude/rules/forge-pydantic.md
Pydantic v2: `model_validate`, `model_dump`, `model_config = ConfigDict(...)`, `@field_validator`, `@model_validator`.

===== .claude/rules/forge-python.md
Python project managed with uv. Tools run from `.venv/bin`. Type checking: basedpyright.

===== .claude/rules/forge-sqlalchemy.md
SQLAlchemy 2.0 async. Models: `class Base(DeclarativeBase)`, `Mapped[T]`, `mapped_column()`, `relationship(back_populates=...)`. Queries: `select()` with `session.execute()` or `session.scalars()`. Sessions: `async_sessionmaker(engine, expire_on_commit=False)`. Related rows load with `selectinload()`.

